# CODEOWNERS — GitHub auto-requests these reviewers on pull requests.
#
# How it works: for a PR, GitHub reads the CODEOWNERS of the PR's *base branch*,
# and the LAST matching pattern wins.
#
# To add people: append their GitHub @handle(s), space-separated, to a line —
# or add a more specific path line above the catch-all. Examples:
#   *                 @you @teammate        # everyone reviews everything
#   /deploy/          @deploy-owner         # route one area to a specific owner
